**FinancialData.Net MCP Server** 

A comprehensive MCP server delivering real-time and historical market data across stocks, ETFs, indices, forex, crypto, commodities, and derivatives. Beyond raw prices, it exposes tools for querying global financial statements, insider trading and ownership logs, institutional holdings, valuation and risk ratios, ESG metrics, and corporate actions. It also includes macroeconomic indicators and event calendars (economic releases, earnings, dividends, splits), enabling agents to run end-to-end workflows—from market screening to corporate and cross-asset analysis—backed by consistent, queryable datasets.

**Link**: 
https://financialdata.net/mcp-server

**Config**:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "financial-data": {
      "type": "remote",
      "url": "https://financialdata.net/mcp?key=API_KEY"
    }
  }
}
```

**The Stall** — 210 pay-per-call AI data tools (stocks, macro, crypto/DeFi, on-chain analytics, weather, government data, and more). Pay with USDC via x402 on Base, or card via Stripe prepaid credits. No API keys, no subscriptions.

MCP (streamable-http): `https://the-stall.intuitek.ai/mcp`

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "the-stall": {
      "type": "streamable-http",
      "url": "https://the-stall.intuitek.ai/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

https://github.com/thebrierfox/the-stall

**vibatchium** — stealth browser automation for AI agents

- **Repository:** https://github.com/trueoriginlabs/vibatchium
- **PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/vibatchium
- **License:** Apache-2.0

One MCP server driving N parallel, persistent **real Google Chrome** sessions (patchright stealth) — not a headless/fake-Chrome fingerprint. Clears Cloudflare/DataDome, per-session credential vault, vision-based clicking, LLM-friendly compact DOM snapshots, and a built-in prompt-injection safety scanner on scraped output.

**Run the MCP server:**

```
uvx --from vibatchium vb mcp
```

stdio transport. Config example:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "vibatchium": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["--from", "vibatchium", "vb", "mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```
